      "@id": "kt:economies-of-scale",
      "@type": "kto:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "Economies of Scale",
      "skos:definition": "The cost advantage a producer gains when expanding output lowers its average (per-unit) cost of production; when further expansion raises average cost instead, the firm faces diseconomies of scale.",
